Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "CyclistCrossingIntersection" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :cyclist1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :rainy1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:cyclist1 a :Cyclist ;
    :description "Cyclist traversing path of vehicle in low light conditions" .

:rainy1 a :RainyCondition .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "High risk of collision with cyclist due to poor visibility and intersection presence" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Collision Risk with cyclist in the vehicle's immediate path during rainy, low-visibility night conditions.
Severity Score: 0.95